  "job_B1.8.5_20251001_193302": {
    "chunk_text": "i, \u00fe\u00e6t we And we sceolon habban on urum handum leohtfatu, \u00fe\u00e6t synd \u00fea godan weorc, \u00fee gode licia\u00f0, o\u00f0rum Eft cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend to his gingrum \u00feuss: Qui mihi ministrat, me seguatur, et cetera: Se \u00f0e me sylfum Se \u00fee Criste \u00feena\u00f0, he sceal him eac folgian \u00e6fre on cl\u00e6num \u00feeawum be Cristes gebysnungum, \u00fe\u00e6t Iohannes, se godspellere, on his gastlican gesih\u00f0e, Apocalipsis gehaten, \u00fee se h\u00e6lend him onwreah, Hi sunt, qui cum mulieribus non sunt coinquinati.",
